<title>USA: Enterprise Federal Bancorp Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Federal Bancorp Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 March 31,	    March 31,</p>
<p>				     1997	1996	1997    1996</p>
<p> Net interest income	   1,821    1,472     3,633   2,923</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	45	 30	  75	30</p>
<p> Net earnings			597	469     1,287   1,094</p>
<p> Earnings per share		.31	.24	 .66     .55</p>
<p>			    (Dollars in Thousands)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The second quarter period ended March 31.</p>
</text>
